@startuml
' A close that lands after the server stopped waiting, and the note that
' lets a later request finish the erasure.
' Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-late-close-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> S : POST the close's signature
S -> C : ask about the signature,\nup to 6 times, 2 s apart
S -> C : read the contract account
C --> S : still there
S -> D : note: a close is pending
S --> B : reload in a moment
hnote over C : the close\nlands at\nsecond 20

== the reader reloads ==

B -> S : GET the meter
S -> D : whose session is this?
D --> S : this wallet, with a pending close
S -> C : read the contract account
C --> S : gone
S -> D : delete sessions, grants, lock row, note
S --> B : no paying wallet stored

note over S, D
  Without the note, the reload cannot tell
  a meter just closed from one never opened.
end note
@enduml
